WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.017
Before moving on, check two foundation ideas.

00:00:04.017 --> 00:00:11.652
First, during normal inference the learned weights stay fixed, while hidden states change with the current prompt and

00:00:11.652 --> 00:00:17.727
with each Transformer layer. Second, the decoder produces log its.

00:00:17.727 --> 00:00:25.507
Those scores become a probability distribution, and the decoding strategy decides which token is selected next.

00:00:25.507 --> 00:00:30.959
If those two ideas are clear, the rest of the module has a much stronger foundation.
